{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the battlefield of <i>FloorBreaker</i>\u2014where skill, strategy, and a touch of satisfying destruction collide!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your opponent stand on opposite sides of the arena, with only layers of fragile floor beneath your feet. There\u2019s only one thing to do:<br><strong>Fire your ball with precision, break the floor under your enemy, and send them plunging into the abyss!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Core Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch bouncing balls to destroy the floor beneath your opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The arena is symmetrical\u2014you can\u2019t cross the line. All attacks come from your aim and timing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your step. One wrong move, and you fall!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Unique Characters &amp; Abilities</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character has its own special mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to pick up, fun to master\u2014with plenty of room for high-level play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Diverse Items &amp; Arena Mechanics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power bounce, ice magic, material swap...<br>Dozens of battle modifiers make every match unpredictable and wild.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Solo or Up to 4 Players</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge smart AI in solo mode,or grab your friends for intense local multiplayer mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ready to play? Grab your ball, smash their footing\u2014</strong><br><strong>and watch them fall, fast and hard!</strong> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3672250?t=1754484862","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672250/e1ef0718be84b2bb5510988ba6123e90c3025b42/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754484862","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672250/c225abb4da1d5f9a4a05cd0226f8dd86f1e843ac/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754484862","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672250/c225abb4da1d5f9a4a05cd0226f8dd86f1e843ac/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754484862","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the battlefield of <i>FloorBreaker</i>\u2014where skill, strategy, and a touch of satisfying destruction collide!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your opponent stand on opposite sides of the arena, with only layers of fragile floor beneath your feet. There\u2019s only one thing to do:<br><strong>Fire your ball with precision, break the floor under your enemy, and send them plunging into the abyss!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Core Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch bouncing balls to destroy the floor beneath your opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The arena is symmetrical\u2014you can\u2019t cross the line. All attacks come from your aim and timing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your step. One wrong move, and you fall!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Unique Characters &amp; Abilities</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character has its own special mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to pick up, fun to master\u2014with plenty of room for high-level play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Diverse Items &amp; Arena Mechanics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power bounce, ice magic, material swap...<br>Dozens of battle modifiers make every match unpredictable and wild.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Solo or Up to 4 Players</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge smart AI in solo mode,or grab your friends for intense local multiplayer mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ready to play? Grab your ball, smash their footing\u2014</strong><br><strong>and watch them fall, fast and hard!</strong> </p>","developers":["PotGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672250/ffca4c0ecb0a67f6b77eeb4cbf555f43a134322d/header.jpg?t=1754484862","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3672250/1027615706/86087a7b4e941ab3ee3aa2d325eba3c78b385060/1754042632/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754484517","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3672250/1027615706/86087a7b4e941ab3ee3aa2d325eba3c78b385060/1754042632/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754484517","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3672250/1027615706/86087a7b4e941ab3ee3aa2d325eba3c78b385060/1754042632/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1754484517","id":257176729,"name":"main","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257176729/c989c20cb6a90c14f16c03f6cab425f6a1424a49/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1754484517"